---
const apkVersion = 'v1.2.0-release';
const apkSize = '34.2 MB';
const minAndroid = 'Android 8.0 (API 26+)';
const sha256Checksum = 'e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855';
const releaseDownloadUrl = 'https://github.com/gymvip-upeu/gymvip-mobile/releases/download/v1.2.0/gymvip-mobile-v1.2.0.apk';
const qrTargetUrl = 'https://gymvip.vercel.app/descargar';
---

<section id="app" class="section mobile-app-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="app-layout">
      <div class="app-info">
        <span class="badge">Tecnología Móvil para Socios</span>
        <h2 class="app-headline">Lleva tu Membresía VIP Siempre en tu Teléfono</h2>
        <p class="app-lead">
          Desarrollada en Kotlin Multiplatform con Compose Multiplatform, la App Oficial de GYM VIP te permite ingresar al gimnasio sin tarjetas físicas, consultar tus asistencias y gestionar tu membresía en segundos.
        </p>

        <div class="app-features-grid">
          <div class="app-feature-box">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <rect x="7" y="7" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                <rect x="14" y="7" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                <rect x="7" y="14" width="3" height="3"></rect>
                <path d="M14 14h3v3h-3z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="feature-title">Acceso con QR Criptográfico</h4>
              <p class="feature-desc">Código QR dinámico que rota cada 60 segundos con firma temporal HMAC. Previene capturas o uso compartido fraudulento.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="app-feature-box">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
                <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
                <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="feature-title">Vigencia y Días Restantes</h4>
              <p class="feature-desc">Consulta clara del estado de tu suscripción, fecha límite de renovación y alertas preventivas antes del vencimiento.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="app-feature-box">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="feature-title">Historial de Entrenamientos</h4>
              <p class="feature-desc">Registro detallado de ingresos y horarios de visita para monitorizar tu constancia semanal y mensual.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="app-feature-box">
            <div class="feature-icon-badge">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path>
                <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
                <path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="feature-title">Catálogo y Pedidos Rápidos</h4>
              <p class="feature-desc">Explora el catálogo de suplementos nutricionales y reserva para recoger y abonar en recepción.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="download-card">
          <div class="download-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Versión Canónica:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">{apkVersion}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Tamaño:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">{apkSize}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Compatibilidad:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">{minAndroid}</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="download-actions">
            <a href={releaseDownloadUrl} class="btn btn-primary btn-download" download>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
              </svg>
              Descargar APK Directo ({apkSize})
            </a>
            <a href="/descargar" class="btn btn-secondary">
              Instrucciones de Instalación
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="checksum-container">
            <span class="checksum-label">Firma Criptográfica SHA-256 Verificada:</span>
            <code class="checksum-hash">{sha256Checksum}</code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="app-visual">
        <div class="phone-mockup">
          <div class="phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="screen-header">
              <span class="screen-brand">VIP CENTER FIT</span>
              <span class="screen-status-badge">ACTIVO</span>
            </div>
            <div class="qr-preview-box">
              <span class="qr-hint">Acceso a Torniquete</span>
              <div class="qr-mock-code">
                <!-- SVG Código QR Ilustrativo -->
                <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" width="130" height="130" class="qr-svg-mock">
                  <rect width="120" height="120" fill="#0A0A0C"/>
                  <rect x="10" y="10" width="30" height="30" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="15" y="15" width="20" height="20" fill="#0A0A0C"/>
                  <rect x="80" y="10" width="30" height="30" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="85" y="15" width="20" height="20" fill="#0A0A0C"/>
                  <rect x="10" y="80" width="30" height="30" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="15" y="85" width="20" height="20" fill="#0A0A0C"/>
                  <rect x="50" y="20" width="10" height="20" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="65" y="10" width="10" height="10" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="50" y="50" width="20" height="20" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="80" y="50" width="10" height="20" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="20" y="50" width="20" height="10" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="50" y="80" width="30" height="10" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                  <rect x="90" y="80" width="20" height="30" fill="#D4AF37"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="qr-timer">⏱️ Rota en 42 segundos</span>
            </div>

            <div class="screen-member-info">
              <div class="member-name">Juan Pérez (VIP-00284)</div>
              <div class="member-plan">Plan VIP Black — 184 días restantes</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="scan-qr-note">
          <p class="scan-label">O escanea con tu móvil para descargar el APK:</p>
          <div class="qr-badge-mini">
            <a href={qrTargetUrl} class="qr-link">
              <span class="scan-cta">📱 Abrir enlace directo de descarga</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mobile-app-section {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.05) 0%, rgba(10, 10, 12, 0) 60%), var(--bg-body);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 90px 0;
  }

  .app-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .app-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .app-headline {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 16px 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .app-lead {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .app-features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .app-features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .app-feature-box {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .feature-icon-badge {
    color: var(--gold-primary);
    background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .download-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .download-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .meta-label {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-right: 6px;
  }

  .meta-value {
    color: var(--gold-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .download-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .btn-download {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-primary), var(--gold-dark));
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .checksum-container {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .checksum-label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .checksum-hash {
    color: var(--gold-hover);
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .app-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .phone-mockup {
    width: 280px;
    background: #111116;
    border: 8px solid #2A2A35;
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 16px 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 40px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
    position: relative;
  }

  .phone-speaker {
    width: 60px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #333340;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px auto;
  }

  .phone-screen {
    background: #0A0A0C;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 20px 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .screen-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1C1C24;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .screen-brand {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold-primary);
  }

  .screen-status-badge {
    background: #10B981;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .qr-preview-box {
    background: #141419;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .qr-hint {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .qr-mock-code {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .qr-timer {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--gold-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    display: block;
  }

  .screen-member-info {
    text-align: left;
    background: #141419;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .member-name {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .member-plan {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .scan-qr-note {
    margin-top: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .scan-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .qr-badge-mini {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .scan-cta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--gold-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
